        {
          "say": "That gives a high boiling point and high specific heat capacity.",
          "write": "c = 4.18 J g⁻¹ °C⁻¹"
        },
        {
          "say": "A high latent heat of vaporisation is why sweating cools you.",
          "write": "sweating cools"
        },
